Feature: URL Shortener Demo
  The demo URL shortener creates short links with expiry times and QR codes.

  Scenario: Create a short link
    When I create a short link for "https://example.com"
    Then the response should contain a short code

  Scenario: Short link redirects to original
    Given a short link for "https://example.com"
    When I visit the short link
    Then I am redirected to "https://example.com"

  Scenario: Expired link shows 410 page
    Given a short link with expiry in the past
    When I visit the short link
    Then I see a 410 Gone page

  Scenario: QR code is generated
    Given a short link for "https://example.com"
    When I request the QR code image
    Then the response is a PNG image